1
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:56,230
Bring it in.

2
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,860
Please sign here.

3
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,970
Okay. As you requested,

4
00:01:34,970 --> 00:01:38,810
we deposited 600 million dollars into your account, sir.

5
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:42,310
You can now withdraw the entire balance...

6
00:01:42,310 --> 00:01:43,880
whenever you like.

7
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:48,750
You became so wealthy at such a young age.

8
00:01:48,890 --> 00:01:50,820
Was it hard work or luck?

9
00:02:49,610 --> 00:02:54,590
(Reborn Rich)

10
00:02:55,490 --> 00:02:58,060
(A week ago in Seoul)

11
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,980
(Episode 1)

12
00:03:32,990 --> 00:03:34,890
("My Era, My Life, My Soonyang")

13
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:39,830
(Level 2 Computer-assisted Audit)

14
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,470
(Soonyang Group Family Tree)

15
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:49,810
We'll move onto the question on page 83.

16
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:53,650
Which of the following isn't true...

17
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,980
about marketable securities?

18
00:03:56,350 --> 00:03:58,050
Equity security...

19
00:03:59,180 --> 00:04:01,290
Equity security is another word for stocks.

20
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:18,670
- Here he comes. - Over here!

21
00:04:19,740 --> 00:04:21,610
Manipulation of stocks, misconduct, and embezzlement.

22
00:04:21,610 --> 00:04:22,970
Do you admit to the charges?

23
00:04:22,970 --> 00:04:24,610
Prison time of 3 years with 5 years probation.

24
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:26,340
What is your take on the sentence?

25
00:04:26,340 --> 00:04:27,380
Did you expect the court...

26
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:28,450
to grant probation in the second trial?

27
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:30,020
Do you have anything to say?

28
00:04:30,050 --> 00:04:32,320
Are you certain there aren't any connections?

29
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,820
(Chairman Jin Young Ki borrowed-name account:)

30
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:35,420
(4.5 billion dollars)

31
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:37,060
I'm impressed, sir.

32
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:39,160
Your acting has gotten better.

33
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:41,430
You look good on camera too.

34
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:44,930
The justice department does its job well, doesn't it?

35
00:04:45,130 --> 00:04:46,700
Fairly and justly.

36
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:51,170
Once again, the outcome was undoubtedly 3 and 5.

37
00:04:51,370 --> 00:04:53,340
Prison time of 3 years with 5 years probation.

38
00:04:53,810 --> 00:04:55,610
As long as you're wealthy enough,

39
00:04:55,810 --> 00:04:59,780
a gracious chairman can get away with professional misconduct,

40
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,480
embezzlement,

41
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:03,010
and even tax evasion...

42
00:05:03,050 --> 00:05:04,550
for a fixed price.

43
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:07,620
A fixed wholesale price of 3 years and 5 years.

44
00:05:07,990 --> 00:05:09,890
It's like the crimes come with a price tag.

45
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,520
Why? Because there can't be a probational period...

46
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,430
for a sentence over three years.

47
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:18,500
Prosecutor Seo.

48
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,600
How will you proceed?

49
00:05:22,270 --> 00:05:25,170
What can we do but adhere to the court's ruling?

50
00:05:25,540 --> 00:05:27,110
What? Really?

51
00:05:27,110 --> 00:05:29,510
We should respect the ruling...

52
00:05:29,910 --> 00:05:31,980
and make an appeal with additional evidence.

53
00:05:32,740 --> 00:05:35,250
We'll have him convicted and imprisoned.

54
00:05:36,250 --> 00:05:37,480
Yes, of course.

55
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:40,350
South Korea is a constitutional state.

56
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:42,150
This isn't the Republic of Soonyang.

57
00:05:43,150 --> 00:05:45,060
(Chairman Jin Yang Cheol Bust Unveiling Ceremony)

58
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:49,790
(In honour of Soonyang's objective that is fairness in business)

59
00:05:49,790 --> 00:05:51,600
Just a second. Excuse me.

60
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,730
Hello, I'm Assistant Manager Shin Gyeong Min.

61
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:03,340
Hello, sir. I'm Assistant Manager Shin Gyeong Min.

62
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:12,520
Hello, I just transferred...

63
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:14,050
to the Future Asset Management Department

64
00:06:14,050 --> 00:06:15,750
I'm Assistant Manager Shin Gyeong Min.

65
00:06:15,790 --> 00:06:17,290
- Is that so? - Yes, sir.

66
00:06:31,370 --> 00:06:33,910
(Jin Young Ki, Son Jeong Rae)

67
00:06:37,210 --> 00:06:39,580
Please collect all products that are set on the table.

68
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:41,050
They will be replaced.

69
00:06:41,350 --> 00:06:44,280
Is there an issue? None are past the expiration date.

70
00:06:44,950 --> 00:06:46,320
Actually, I should first ask who you are.

71
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,790
The chairman is allergic to peaches.

72
00:06:47,790 --> 00:06:49,090
He might lose consciousness from respiratory distress...

73
00:06:49,090 --> 00:06:50,420
because of this beverage.

74
00:06:50,420 --> 00:06:51,590
(Peach juice concentrate 2 percent)

75
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:54,130
(Shin Gyeong Min)

76
00:06:54,790 --> 00:06:56,930
- Assistant Manager Shin. - Yes?

77
00:06:57,130 --> 00:06:58,230
I'm Senior Manager Yoon Hyeon Woo...

78
00:06:58,230 --> 00:06:59,300
of the Future Asset Management Department.

79
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:01,170
Yoon Hyeon Woo?

80
00:07:01,670 --> 00:07:03,870
The one I've heard stories about?

81
00:07:04,870 --> 00:07:06,200
I apologize for the belated greeting.

82
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,340
I'm Shin Gyeong Min, the newest member of your team.

83
00:07:09,810 --> 00:07:11,210
We don't have time for that. Let us hurry.

84
00:07:11,210 --> 00:07:12,310
Yes, sir.

85
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:15,280
- Remove those beverages. - Sure.

86
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:19,980
What should one do to be like you?

87
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:22,120
I hear the brutal workload...

88
00:07:22,150 --> 00:07:23,920
has the average person quit in less than three years.

89
00:07:24,090 --> 00:07:26,160
You're the only one who held out for more than five,

90
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,990
and you serve the chairman as one of his most trusted employees.

91
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,030
Allow me, sir.

92
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:37,740
I want to be just like you, Mr. Yoon.

93
00:07:38,170 --> 00:07:41,740
Could you share some pointers? I'm a quick study, you see.

94
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:43,680
Let me see your phone.

95
00:07:44,810 --> 00:07:47,280
Gosh, are we exchanging numbers?

96
00:07:49,350 --> 00:07:50,920
It isn't one of Soonyang's.

97
00:07:53,550 --> 00:07:55,550
I'll get a new one right away!

98
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:59,120
Could he be any sexier?

99
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,430
- Can you look this way? - Over here!

100
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:10,640
- Please look this way. - Can you look this way?

101
00:08:10,670 --> 00:08:12,540
- Over here. - Sir, please.

102
00:08:12,540 --> 00:08:16,110
- Could you look this way? - Sir, over here.

103
00:08:16,110 --> 00:08:18,340
- Over here, please. - Please look this way.

104
00:08:18,380 --> 00:08:20,780
- This way, please. - How have you been doing?

105
00:08:20,780 --> 00:08:23,250
Attention. 1-0, 1-alpha are entering the building.

106
00:08:23,750 --> 00:08:24,820
Let us hurry.

107
00:08:26,180 --> 00:08:28,590
Mr. Yoon, what does "1-0" mean?

108
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:31,690
We are not allowed to refer to the chairman's family by name.

109
00:08:32,190 --> 00:08:33,900
The chairman who is the eldest goes by 1-0,

110
00:08:33,980 --> 00:08:35,600
and his wife is 1-alpha.

111
00:08:35,790 --> 00:08:36,930
The vice-chairman goes by 2-0,

112
00:08:36,930 --> 00:08:39,030
his wife is 2-alpha, and his daughter is 2-1.

113
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,530
And so on and so forth.

114
00:08:52,410 --> 00:08:55,310
I have 1-1 and 1-2 travelling up from the parking lot.

115
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:59,420
What is it? What is this about?

116
00:08:59,780 --> 00:09:01,690
Can't you give me a heads up?

117
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,590
The ceremony will soon commence.

118
00:09:03,590 --> 00:09:07,430
I don't know what this is about, but tell him after the ceremony.

119
00:09:08,830 --> 00:09:12,960
Don't you know who Father is having this ceremony for?

120
00:09:13,970 --> 00:09:15,430
The press, prominent social figures,

121
00:09:15,430 --> 00:09:16,900
and members of your exceptional family...

122
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:18,440
will be focused on you today.

123
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,740
Are you going to ruin it for yourself?

124
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,410
Sir.

125
00:09:30,650 --> 00:09:31,750
Father!

126
00:09:42,030 --> 00:09:43,390
The succession...

127
00:09:45,130 --> 00:09:46,300
within Soonyang Group?

128
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:50,130
It won't go as planned.

129
00:09:53,540 --> 00:09:55,440
Because I'm renouncing my inheritance.

130
00:09:56,810 --> 00:09:57,880
What?

131
00:09:58,910 --> 00:10:03,750
Shortly at 11am, we will commence the bust unveiling ceremony...

132
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:06,920
of Soonyang Group's founder, the late Chairman Jin Yang Cheol.

133
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:07,950
(Family, Jin Hwa Young)

134
00:10:07,950 --> 00:10:11,320
We ask all guests present at the event...

135
00:10:11,490 --> 00:10:14,690
to take their seats in order to ensure a peaceful ceremony.

136
00:10:15,330 --> 00:10:18,560
We will soon commence the bust unveiling ceremony.

137
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:20,970
(Jin Seong Jun, Jin Young Ki, Son Jeong Rae)

138
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:30,210
The accident that day.

139
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:34,080
Did you think I would never find out?

140
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:37,520
- Seong Jun. - It's over, Father.

141
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:40,650
(Chairman Jin Young Ki)

142
00:10:40,690 --> 00:10:41,820
Pride...

143
00:10:42,690 --> 00:10:45,390
is only feared when someone is worthy enough.

144
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:48,060
How dare you renounce your inheritance!

145
00:10:50,030 --> 00:10:53,160
Especially when you haven't earned even a penny...

146
00:10:53,530 --> 00:10:54,600
on your own before.

147
00:10:56,930 --> 00:10:58,140
The house you live in,

148
00:10:58,770 --> 00:11:02,140
your car, your title, your wife,

149
00:11:03,070 --> 00:11:05,410
and even your name.

150
00:11:06,710 --> 00:11:08,410
What you have been enjoying...

151
00:11:09,350 --> 00:11:13,790
were given to you by me, your grandfather, and Soonyang.

152
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,190
Pride...

153
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:21,760
is a luxury for only those...

154
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:23,560
who can actually leave the lifestyle behind.

155
00:11:26,060 --> 00:11:27,900
You are not a man of such calibre.

156
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:30,670
No one knows that more than I do.

157
00:11:34,810 --> 00:11:36,170
All I did...

158
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:40,280
was my best as your father.

159
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:46,420
It was for my sake, you say?

160
00:11:49,550 --> 00:11:50,690
You...

161
00:11:52,620 --> 00:11:55,660
have been suffocating me in the cruellest way.

162
00:11:57,660 --> 00:11:59,160
That I'm not worthy.

163
00:12:00,330 --> 00:12:02,830
That I'm not a man who can lead Soonyang.

164
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:08,340
You told me that in your own way...

165
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,310
by making that choice that day.

166
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,650
This is me living up to expectations.

167
00:12:20,020 --> 00:12:21,020
Don't go.

168
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:23,050
Don't...

169
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:37,970
Chairman Jin, it's time.

170
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:40,910
Chairman Jin?

171
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:44,040
Chairman Jin, it's Yoon Hyeon Woo.

172
00:12:48,180 --> 00:12:50,180
Sir!

173
00:12:52,450 --> 00:12:53,450
Sir?

174
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:58,590
Send paramedics to the chairman's office.

175
00:12:58,590 --> 00:12:59,660
This is an emergency.

176
00:13:01,160 --> 00:13:03,030
Sir?

177
00:13:03,930 --> 00:13:04,960
Sir!

178
00:13:09,270 --> 00:13:10,330
Darn it.

179
00:13:16,370 --> 00:13:17,910
Come on. Hurry!

180
00:13:25,650 --> 00:13:27,520
You said Young Ki would be behind bars.

181
00:13:28,550 --> 00:13:30,690
Never do you keep your promises.

182
00:13:31,660 --> 00:13:33,190
Darn politicians.

183
00:13:33,420 --> 00:13:36,330
Politics should be conducted on a broad perspective.

184
00:13:36,330 --> 00:13:37,730
The whole nation shouldn't have to suffer...

185
00:13:37,730 --> 00:13:39,160
from a family feud.

186
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:41,530
"Soonyang runs the South Korean economy."

187
00:13:41,530 --> 00:13:43,100
Your family takes pride in that.

188
00:13:43,130 --> 00:13:45,340
I'm close to witnessing Seong Jun's coronation...

189
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:48,740
at the ceremony designed to commemorate my father...

190
00:13:49,310 --> 00:13:51,140
all while clapping my hands off.

191
00:13:51,180 --> 00:13:54,480
It's why you should've supported me back then...

192
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,810
instead of your own family.

193
00:13:55,810 --> 00:13:56,950
If you had done that,

194
00:13:56,950 --> 00:13:58,080
it would've been you claiming the throne.

195
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:00,020
- No way. - Yes way.

196
00:14:00,020 --> 00:14:01,550
- No way. - Yes way.

197
00:14:01,550 --> 00:14:03,620
- How mature of you. - I'm glad you noticed.

198
00:14:03,650 --> 00:14:05,520
- Is it dementia you have? - You know nothing about...

199
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:07,120
Goodness, Director Kim.

200
00:14:08,460 --> 00:14:10,230
So? What is this about?

201
00:14:10,230 --> 00:14:12,330
Allow me to tell you inside.

202
00:14:23,210 --> 00:14:24,210
What is this?

203
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:26,880
Why did you gather us in private?

204
00:14:28,780 --> 00:14:32,280
The chairman is currently receiving emergency surgery...

205
00:14:33,050 --> 00:14:36,250
for acute myocardial infarction.

206
00:14:36,590 --> 00:14:37,690
What?

207
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,330
What about the unveiling ceremony?

208
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:49,170
We will proceed as planned.

209
00:14:49,400 --> 00:14:53,200
Issuing a press release will hurt our stock price.

210
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:56,170
The special announcement...

211
00:14:56,440 --> 00:15:00,210
should come from the chairman for it to be meaningful.

212
00:15:00,210 --> 00:15:01,850
- Of course. - The chairman of a company...

213
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:03,450
who the prosecution just released...

214
00:15:03,450 --> 00:15:05,550
was now met with a health issue.

215
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:09,490
Displaying lack of leadership won't help the business.

216
00:15:09,490 --> 00:15:10,890
So?

217
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:14,760
Who should announce it instead?

218
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:17,130
Honey, did you bring another necktie?

219
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:19,660
It's in the car. Should I get it?

220
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:21,170
Yes.

221
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:23,030
Vice-Chairman Jin Seong Jun should give the announcement.

222
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:27,000
What?

223
00:15:27,310 --> 00:15:28,510
The announcement.

224
00:15:28,670 --> 00:15:30,110
The restructuring of the organization hierarchy...

225
00:15:30,110 --> 00:15:31,540
may seem complex,

226
00:15:31,610 --> 00:15:33,280
but the issue at hand is simple.

227
00:15:33,710 --> 00:15:35,380
How will Soonyang resolve its issue...

228
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:37,080
surrounding the succession?

229
00:15:37,580 --> 00:15:38,620
Don't they all want to see...

230
00:15:38,650 --> 00:15:40,520
the vice-chairman step up to the plate?

231
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:44,090
The government, the people, and also our shareholders.

232
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:47,290
Don't you agree, Hyeon Min?

233
00:16:09,550 --> 00:16:10,580
I hear you summoned me.

234
00:16:11,650 --> 00:16:15,320
You never have to ask Mr. Yoon twice.

235
00:16:20,990 --> 00:16:22,660
After the unveiling ceremony,

236
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:25,700
Soonyang will make a special public announcement.

237
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:29,430
Vice-Chairman Jin Seong Jun will be giving the speech.

238
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:33,940
The ceremony will be over in 30 minutes.

239
00:16:34,110 --> 00:16:36,440
Wherever he went, you are to find him...

240
00:16:37,010 --> 00:16:38,210
and bring him to me.

241
00:16:38,310 --> 00:16:40,240
Time isn't a luxury we have, Mr. Yoon.

242
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:41,880
You must hurry.

243
00:16:46,620 --> 00:16:50,650
If he isn't on the podium by that time,

244
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:54,130
you will no longer have a place at Soonyang.

245
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:01,800
The shortest route to the hotel will get you back in 20 minutes.

246
00:17:03,070 --> 00:17:04,670
- I'll drive. - Sure.

247
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,940
The only problem is that the nearby department store...

248
00:17:09,940 --> 00:17:11,480
is having a sales event, and it's lunch hour.

249
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,510
If we get stalled at the hotel,

250
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:15,880
thirty minutes won't be enough.

251
00:17:17,150 --> 00:17:19,920
You should formally complain about the unreasonable task.

252
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:21,820
You said you wanted to be like me.

253
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:23,550
Of course.

254
00:17:23,590 --> 00:17:25,490
- You wish for a long career. - Yes.

255
00:17:25,890 --> 00:17:27,490
There are three things I never do.

256
00:17:27,990 --> 00:17:29,460
Three things. Just a second.

257
00:17:30,130 --> 00:17:32,130
I never reject orders made by the chairman's family.

258
00:17:32,700 --> 00:17:34,670
I never ask questions, and...

259
00:17:40,340 --> 00:17:43,370
I never make my own judgement.

260
00:17:45,180 --> 00:17:46,180
Those are my rules.

261
00:18:29,090 --> 00:18:31,490
Excuse me. Vice-Chairman Jin?

262
00:18:37,230 --> 00:18:38,230
Vice-Chairman Jin?

263
00:18:43,270 --> 00:18:44,370
Quiet.

264
00:18:46,740 --> 00:18:48,670
I can hear them speak.

265
00:18:50,670 --> 00:18:54,410
They can sense tremor on the sides of their bodies.

266
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:58,020
Right now, they're speaking loudly.

267
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,220
They want us to be quiet.

268
00:19:03,850 --> 00:19:05,620
French cuisine...

269
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:07,460
made from seasonal ingredients will be served...

270
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:09,690
When in danger,

271
00:19:10,730 --> 00:19:13,060
they send out a distress signal.

272
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:16,370
Do you know what it is?

273
00:19:16,370 --> 00:19:19,270
If you're not interested, we will not serve lunch today.

274
00:19:24,610 --> 00:19:25,680
Sir?

275
00:19:27,380 --> 00:19:28,380
Vice-Chairman Jin?

276
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:32,920
Didn't I tell you to be quiet?

277
00:19:34,190 --> 00:19:35,190
I just said it.

278
00:19:37,190 --> 00:19:38,720
Please!

279
00:19:51,570 --> 00:19:53,070
I ruined it.

280
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:54,940
I ruined it!

281
00:19:56,410 --> 00:19:58,440
You knew the answer!

282
00:20:03,010 --> 00:20:05,950
You will pee.

283
00:20:08,390 --> 00:20:09,720
Just like now.

284
00:20:15,460 --> 00:20:18,630
One, two, three!

285
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:36,450
Who called you smart when you are the opposite?

286
00:20:37,050 --> 00:20:39,920
Why would you let Seong Jun make the announcement?

287
00:20:40,450 --> 00:20:42,920
You'd only be solidifying his position at the company.

288
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:44,190
Don't you know that?

289
00:20:45,260 --> 00:20:47,990
That'll only be true when he makes the announcement.

290
00:20:49,690 --> 00:20:52,700
Are you saying he won't be here?

291
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:54,730
It'll be official.

292
00:20:55,430 --> 00:20:58,070
Vice-Chairman Jin Seong Jun...

293
00:20:58,240 --> 00:21:01,170
is a bit too dangerous to take on the mantle.

294
00:21:17,350 --> 00:21:19,090
Darn it!

295
00:21:19,390 --> 00:21:20,860
If you had been quiet,

296
00:21:21,430 --> 00:21:23,230
none of this would've happened.

297
00:21:26,030 --> 00:21:30,470
Once again, you think I'm the bad guy.

298
00:21:31,170 --> 00:21:33,270
Why make me out to be one...

299
00:21:33,470 --> 00:21:35,540
when you're the ones at fault?

300
00:21:36,710 --> 00:21:37,780
Why?

301
00:21:40,210 --> 00:21:41,210
Mr. Jin...

302
00:21:42,150 --> 00:21:44,420
Mr. Yoon, are you all right?

303
00:21:49,220 --> 00:21:51,390
Mr. Shin, escort everyone out.

304
00:21:51,590 --> 00:21:53,260
Sure. Let us leave. Come on.

305
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,060
Oh, no.

306
00:22:27,830 --> 00:22:29,230
This happened in 1987,

307
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:33,160
at the 60th birthday party for your grandfather,

308
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:34,870
former Chairman Jin.

309
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:38,700
You smashed the Goryeo celadon that he cherished...

310
00:22:39,470 --> 00:22:42,370
and was scolded by him for the first time.

311
00:22:42,410 --> 00:22:44,740
- What? - Not because of the celadon.

312
00:22:47,950 --> 00:22:50,710
Because being driven by emotions...

313
00:22:51,350 --> 00:22:53,720
wasn't an adequate quality in someone...

314
00:22:56,220 --> 00:22:58,460
who were to run a business that is Soonyang.

315
00:22:58,460 --> 00:23:00,420
- Mr. Yoon! - I read it...

316
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:02,960
in his autobiography.

317
00:23:03,890 --> 00:23:06,400
Since that day, you honed his teachings...

318
00:23:06,430 --> 00:23:08,730
and gave thought to the true qualities of a businessman.

319
00:23:08,870 --> 00:23:09,900
That is how...

320
00:23:11,870 --> 00:23:13,170
you were able...

321
00:23:14,510 --> 00:23:17,210
to become the responsible and prudent businessman.

322
00:23:17,810 --> 00:23:20,640
The PR team is putting together a press release.

323
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:23,150
You were only late to the unveiling ceremony...

324
00:23:23,980 --> 00:23:26,220
because you stayed behind until the last second...

325
00:23:26,450 --> 00:23:29,590
in order to cautiously reflect the late chairman's...

326
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,590
management philosophy...

327
00:23:33,360 --> 00:23:35,360
in the announcement.

328
00:23:35,860 --> 00:23:37,630
The ceremony ends...

329
00:23:38,700 --> 00:23:39,930
in 12 minutes.

330
00:23:40,700 --> 00:23:42,370
If you make it there by that time,

331
00:23:43,570 --> 00:23:45,970
no one will take issue with today's events.

332
00:23:58,950 --> 00:24:00,120
Wait for me outside.

333
00:24:25,380 --> 00:24:29,180
The chairman is currently receiving emergency surgery.

334
00:24:30,910 --> 00:24:34,950
What happened in that room before he collapsed...

335
00:24:37,350 --> 00:24:39,420
will never become public knowledge.

336
00:24:46,660 --> 00:24:48,070
For I...

337
00:24:50,570 --> 00:24:51,940
will never talk.

338
00:24:56,810 --> 00:24:58,010
You have ten minutes.

339
00:24:58,480 --> 00:25:00,280
I only ask for your cooperation.

340
00:25:30,570 --> 00:25:33,180
Promoting nonsense such as...

341
00:25:34,380 --> 00:25:36,350
open-mind management...

342
00:25:36,610 --> 00:25:40,220
has mutts barking at their owners, Mr. Yoon.

343
00:25:51,430 --> 00:25:52,830
Have the car ready.

344
00:25:57,170 --> 00:25:59,340
Thank you, Mr. Jin.

345
00:26:00,140 --> 00:26:01,170
Thank you.

346
00:26:29,970 --> 00:26:32,240
Gosh. I apologize for my tardiness.

347
00:26:34,610 --> 00:26:37,170
Our Soonyang...

348
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:42,350
wishes to do its due diligence as one of Korea's top companies...

349
00:26:43,010 --> 00:26:46,150
by being reliable and by meeting the ethical standard of the people.

350
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:50,420
Soonyang will be restructured as a holding company...

351
00:26:50,420 --> 00:26:52,320
to improve asset quality...

352
00:26:52,360 --> 00:26:53,860
which is an issue the group has been numerously...

353
00:26:53,960 --> 00:26:55,760
called out on.

354
00:26:57,230 --> 00:26:58,800
(Family)

355
00:26:58,830 --> 00:27:00,700
(Family)

356
00:27:02,070 --> 00:27:03,430
I am well aware...

357
00:27:04,130 --> 00:27:08,110
that Soonyang has been criticized for evading the law...

358
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:13,180
during its tumultuous former succession processes.

359
00:27:15,210 --> 00:27:18,720
We will accept any criticism that comes our way,

360
00:27:19,550 --> 00:27:22,990
and do our best to honestly answer...

361
00:27:23,520 --> 00:27:24,860
to the needs of time.

362
00:27:26,720 --> 00:27:28,060
Soonyang's innovation...

363
00:27:28,690 --> 00:27:32,000
won't stay limited to its technology and products.

364
00:27:32,930 --> 00:27:34,100
In that sense,

365
00:27:34,670 --> 00:27:36,170
the huge amount of profit that will be levied...

366
00:27:36,170 --> 00:27:37,700
as a result of the shares traded...

367
00:27:37,700 --> 00:27:39,770
by all subsidiary companies during the transition...

368
00:27:39,770 --> 00:27:42,510
will be paid faithfully and accurately.

369
00:27:46,410 --> 00:27:47,640
That little brat.

370
00:27:49,710 --> 00:27:52,920
What on earth is that brat blabbering about?

371
00:27:55,090 --> 00:27:56,390
A business that'll benefit the nation.

372
00:27:56,990 --> 00:27:58,020
Fairness in business.

373
00:27:59,420 --> 00:28:01,060
I will honour the wishes of my grandfather,

374
00:28:01,060 --> 00:28:02,860
former Chairman Jin Yang Cheol,

375
00:28:03,990 --> 00:28:06,130
and let Soonyang be reborn as a company...

376
00:28:06,600 --> 00:28:08,230
that is cherished by the people.

377
00:28:14,940 --> 00:28:18,010
(Family)

378
00:29:22,340 --> 00:29:23,640
Gyeong Min, you probably know.

379
00:29:24,270 --> 00:29:25,480
Tell us.

380
00:29:25,980 --> 00:29:28,580
What happened to Mr. Yoon's face?

381
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:30,650
As if you need to ask.

382
00:29:31,050 --> 00:29:33,480
Everyone knows that 1-1 can be violent.

383
00:29:33,980 --> 00:29:37,150
Even after the humiliation,

384
00:29:37,190 --> 00:29:39,220
I bet he'll act all high and mighty...

385
00:29:39,220 --> 00:29:41,060
as the senior manager at Soonyang.

386
00:29:41,060 --> 00:29:42,160
Mr. Yoon.

387
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:45,260
He's incredible.

388
00:29:45,730 --> 00:29:47,600
Not anyone can be the chairman's right-hand man.

389
00:29:49,170 --> 00:29:50,570
He's no right-hand man.

390
00:29:50,770 --> 00:29:52,970
A dirty glove he wears on his right hand, maybe.

391
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:55,770
You know, the cheap kind you wear...

392
00:29:55,910 --> 00:29:58,410
to keep your hands clean that can be replaced at any time.

393
00:29:58,610 --> 00:30:02,080
To be honest, he doesn't have the qualifications.

394
00:30:02,410 --> 00:30:04,150
He was a handpicked high-school graduate.

395
00:30:04,350 --> 00:30:05,850
They're easily done away with.

396
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:09,190
What qualified guy in the right mind would do what he does?

397
00:30:09,190 --> 00:30:13,090
But look at Mr. Yoon. He stakes his life to serve.

398
00:30:13,260 --> 00:30:14,860
He has to.

399
00:30:15,560 --> 00:30:17,230
He's not good at much else.

400
00:30:23,670 --> 00:30:25,870
(1-alpha)

401
00:30:28,170 --> 00:30:29,570
Hello, ma'am, Yoon speaking.

402
00:30:29,610 --> 00:30:30,910
Sorry for taking my time.

403
00:30:32,610 --> 00:30:35,510
Yes, I understand. I'll be right over. Bye.

404
00:31:42,780 --> 00:31:44,150
It's done, ma'am.

405
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:54,760
You know,

406
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:57,660
I feel uncomfortable, Mr. Yoon.

407
00:31:58,900 --> 00:32:00,900
I know he has a carer,

408
00:32:00,900 --> 00:32:03,870
but I'm stuck here as long as my husband is.

409
00:32:04,370 --> 00:32:07,840
You know how particular I am about cleanliness.

410
00:32:08,740 --> 00:32:11,210
Must I call and give instructions...

411
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:13,680
regarding minute details?

412
00:32:15,380 --> 00:32:16,380
I apologize.

413
00:32:17,310 --> 00:32:18,650
I was neglectful.

414
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:24,090
I'm not a stingy person, am I?

415
00:32:36,700 --> 00:32:40,700
I know my manners.

416
00:32:41,470 --> 00:32:42,470
Here.

417
00:32:42,840 --> 00:32:45,210
Not at all. It's fine.

418
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:46,880
Go on.

419
00:32:48,280 --> 00:32:49,350
Take it.

420
00:32:50,510 --> 00:32:51,510
Yes?

421
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:53,720
Yes. Thank you.

422
00:33:12,140 --> 00:33:13,240
(Soonyang Medical Center)

423
00:33:15,770 --> 00:33:17,010
Hi, I'm late.

424
00:33:17,770 --> 00:33:19,410
I'm leaving now.

425
00:33:38,900 --> 00:33:42,300
Hyeon Woo. Have some braised ribs.

426
00:33:46,170 --> 00:33:48,440
Your mom got spoiled today.

427
00:33:48,610 --> 00:33:50,910
She got served by her eldest son.

428
00:33:51,510 --> 00:33:53,180
You didn't make it last year,

429
00:33:53,180 --> 00:33:55,280
and Mom waited for a while.

430
00:33:56,150 --> 00:33:57,950
I tried to burn the prayer after the rite,

431
00:33:57,950 --> 00:33:59,820
but it just wouldn't burn.

432
00:34:00,150 --> 00:34:02,220
This is how it has always been.

433
00:34:03,490 --> 00:34:04,750
Mom will understand.

434
00:34:05,590 --> 00:34:08,020
Oh, I forgot to bring the soup.

435
00:34:18,600 --> 00:34:19,670
Hyeon Woo.

436
00:34:20,170 --> 00:34:21,170
Yes?

437
00:34:23,510 --> 00:34:24,810
This is for you.

438
00:34:26,680 --> 00:34:27,710
What is it?

439
00:34:31,750 --> 00:34:34,520
I got my first paycheck.

440
00:34:36,920 --> 00:34:38,090
You're working?

441
00:34:41,020 --> 00:34:42,030
What about the civil service exam?

442
00:34:43,530 --> 00:34:45,230
I quit studying for that.

443
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:46,930
If I couldn't pass for so long,

444
00:34:47,700 --> 00:34:48,900
it's not meant to be.

445
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:52,570
I can't ask you to pay my expenses and classes forever.

446
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:58,370
Are you afraid I can't support you?

447
00:34:59,010 --> 00:35:00,780
- It's not that. - Hyeon Min.

448
00:35:02,150 --> 00:35:03,450
Do you think little of me too?

449
00:35:04,050 --> 00:35:07,580
You've done more than enough for Dad and me.

450
00:35:08,420 --> 00:35:10,990
Now I want to help out.

451
00:35:12,520 --> 00:35:13,920
You've shouldered the burden so far.

452
00:35:16,030 --> 00:35:18,460
Your brother has a point.

453
00:35:20,630 --> 00:35:23,200
You should live for yourself now.

454
00:35:24,070 --> 00:35:27,740
You may work at the greatest company in the country,

455
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:31,110
at a successful job working for the highest people there.

456
00:35:31,270 --> 00:35:34,380
But you must have a family of your own...

457
00:35:35,280 --> 00:35:38,450
to be able to call yourself a real man and a grown-up.

458
00:35:45,090 --> 00:35:48,630
I should have a wife and kids, a family of my own?

459
00:35:51,060 --> 00:35:54,600
Is that what made you a dignified man?

460
00:35:55,800 --> 00:35:56,800
Father.

461
00:35:57,730 --> 00:36:00,170
Do you have the right to say that to me?

462
00:36:00,940 --> 00:36:01,940
Father.

463
00:36:03,940 --> 00:36:05,880
It's Mom's death anniversary.

464
00:36:06,940 --> 00:36:09,280
It's the anniversary of her death of all days.

465
00:36:09,280 --> 00:36:10,950
- And you're saying... - Hyeon Woo.

466
00:36:12,550 --> 00:36:13,580
Stop it.

467
00:36:18,020 --> 00:36:19,190
Whatever.

468
00:36:21,520 --> 00:36:22,630
You're leaving already?

469
00:36:23,660 --> 00:36:24,660
Bye.

470
00:36:24,690 --> 00:36:27,030
Hyeon Woo. Why not stay the night?

471
00:36:37,440 --> 00:36:38,510
Hyeon Woo.

472
00:37:05,340 --> 00:37:06,740
(Lawyer Son, Legal)

473
00:37:07,000 --> 00:37:09,640
Move it, okay? You're too slow.

474
00:37:09,640 --> 00:37:11,610
Let's be quick.

475
00:37:20,050 --> 00:37:21,320
(Jeongsimjae 1F)

476
00:37:21,320 --> 00:37:23,120
(Jeongsimjae 2F)

477
00:37:23,120 --> 00:37:24,950
(Soonyang Group Family Tree)

478
00:37:24,990 --> 00:37:26,590
(Late Jin Yang Cheol, Late Lee Pil Ok)

479
00:37:32,900 --> 00:37:36,300
("My Era, My Life, My Soonyang")

480
00:37:37,670 --> 00:37:40,600
Take all the files, even if they're double-sided.

481
00:37:41,240 --> 00:37:43,010
- Empty all the drawers. - Okay.

482
00:37:44,110 --> 00:37:46,110
Hurry up. Be quick.

483
00:37:46,810 --> 00:37:50,180
Take the hard drives, files, everything.

484
00:37:50,180 --> 00:37:51,910
Don't leave anything behind.

485
00:37:55,220 --> 00:37:56,490
(Prosecutors' Office)

486
00:37:57,250 --> 00:37:58,620
Who's in charge here?

487
00:37:59,020 --> 00:38:00,190
Let's see the warrant.

488
00:38:16,840 --> 00:38:20,280
Senior Manager Yoon Hyeon Woo, Future Asset Management Department.

489
00:38:21,810 --> 00:38:24,980
Prosecutor Seo Min Yeong with the Anti-corruption Team.

490
00:38:26,720 --> 00:38:29,120
Let's see the search and seizure warrant.

491
00:38:31,850 --> 00:38:32,890
I'll take it.

492
00:38:42,570 --> 00:38:45,470
We suspect Soonyang Chemicals and Soonyang World's window dressing...

493
00:38:45,470 --> 00:38:49,440
was set up by Soonyang Corporation's Planning and Coordination.

494
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:55,180
The goal would be Vice-Chairman Jin Seong Jun's illegal takeover.

495
00:38:55,450 --> 00:38:59,150
Soonyang does not bend or break any laws in the succession process.

496
00:38:59,650 --> 00:39:01,620
As per the special statement that was read out yesterday.

497
00:39:01,620 --> 00:39:02,750
I interpreted that differently.

498
00:39:03,590 --> 00:39:06,220
"To be able to afford the massive amount of taxes..."

499
00:39:06,260 --> 00:39:08,620
"that would occur in the process,"

500
00:39:08,760 --> 00:39:10,530
"the owner family including Jin Young Ki..."

501
00:39:10,890 --> 00:39:13,530
"and Jin Seong Jun have enough funds stashed aside."

502
00:39:15,200 --> 00:39:16,670
It sounded like a confession to me.

503
00:39:17,470 --> 00:39:19,740
And I couldn't ignore that confession.

504
00:39:21,740 --> 00:39:23,940
- If we're done, let's go. - Okay.

505
00:39:24,510 --> 00:39:26,380
Pack up. It's time to go.

506
00:39:34,350 --> 00:39:36,420
The Future Asset Management Department?

507
00:39:36,720 --> 00:39:40,090
That means the owner family is the future asset.

508
00:39:42,260 --> 00:39:44,030
Do you really think so?

509
00:39:48,800 --> 00:39:51,100
They call you "Soonyang's Grim Reaper."

510
00:39:58,170 --> 00:40:00,510
Not only do you only wear black,

511
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:03,650
you indict anyone without a care...

512
00:40:03,650 --> 00:40:05,550
if Soonyang's involved somehow.

513
00:40:07,580 --> 00:40:10,920
Do you want to gain fame for taking Soonyang down or...

514
00:40:12,290 --> 00:40:15,430
is there a personal vendetta others don't know about?

515
00:40:17,890 --> 00:40:19,830
There's a lot of gossip about you.

516
00:40:21,500 --> 00:40:23,300
I don't think it's either.

517
00:40:24,670 --> 00:40:25,970
I think...

518
00:40:26,840 --> 00:40:29,510
you're just doing your job as best you can.

519
00:40:31,870 --> 00:40:33,210
The same goes for me as well.

520
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:38,580
Do you take special lessons?

521
00:40:40,050 --> 00:40:41,320
You're quite eloquent.

522
00:40:53,700 --> 00:40:55,130
(Prosecutors' Office)

523
00:40:56,700 --> 00:40:58,940
(Seoul District Public Prosecutors' Office)

524
00:41:00,440 --> 00:41:01,440
Is it true?

525
00:41:04,910 --> 00:41:08,180
All the computers are new, never used once,

526
00:41:08,950 --> 00:41:11,110
and other than the first few pages,

527
00:41:11,150 --> 00:41:14,420
the files are printouts of PR stuff and of Soonyang's history.

528
00:41:16,220 --> 00:41:17,420
It has to be that...

529
00:41:18,250 --> 00:41:21,620
they knew we'd be coming and they were prepared.

530
00:42:16,780 --> 00:42:18,080
- Mr. Shin. - Yes?

531
00:42:20,050 --> 00:42:21,720
Planning and Coordination's seating chart.

532
00:42:22,720 --> 00:42:25,090
Replace all the computers as assigned.

533
00:42:25,090 --> 00:42:26,360
Yes, sir.

534
00:42:28,120 --> 00:42:30,890
I sent a list of files to either keep or delete.

535
00:42:32,300 --> 00:42:34,900
It's a sensitive job, so be extra careful.

536
00:42:35,200 --> 00:42:36,470
Yes, sir.

537
00:42:40,870 --> 00:42:41,870
Mr. Shin.

538
00:42:43,140 --> 00:42:44,340
You got a new phone?

539
00:42:45,270 --> 00:42:46,440
Oh, yes.

540
00:42:51,250 --> 00:42:52,320
Mr. Yoon.

541
00:42:56,420 --> 00:42:57,490
So...

542
00:42:58,190 --> 00:43:01,760
I apologize. What happened yesterday...

543
00:43:03,130 --> 00:43:05,230
I'm off to report to the Vice-Chairman.

544
00:43:06,530 --> 00:43:07,830
Do you want to tag along?

545
00:43:10,970 --> 00:43:11,970
Yes.

546
00:43:19,510 --> 00:43:21,880
Prosecutors are so weird.

547
00:43:23,380 --> 00:43:26,050
I said I'd abide by the law, and they attacked me first.

548
00:43:28,220 --> 00:43:29,590
It makes me want to retaliate.

549
00:43:32,290 --> 00:43:34,860
What's the likelihood of another search and seizure?

550
00:43:35,190 --> 00:43:37,560
It is very unlikely.

551
00:43:38,290 --> 00:43:40,630
I already gave Mr. Yoon the necessary instructions.

552
00:43:41,200 --> 00:43:43,230
He'll work with Planning and Coordination,

553
00:43:43,230 --> 00:43:44,970
and any problematic files...

554
00:43:45,230 --> 00:43:47,840
will be carefully separated and deleted forever.

555
00:43:48,170 --> 00:43:49,540
Even if prosecutors come by again,

556
00:43:50,240 --> 00:43:54,040
they won't find anything illegal or suspicious, sir.

557
00:44:26,710 --> 00:44:28,140
You do a good job.

558
00:44:30,780 --> 00:44:31,980
Thank you.

559
00:44:47,030 --> 00:44:49,070
(Soonyang Medical Center)

560
00:44:56,440 --> 00:44:58,810
Who was that gentleman?

561
00:44:59,610 --> 00:45:01,580
He's 4-0, Advisor Jin Yoon Ki.

562
00:45:02,950 --> 00:45:05,150
Chairman Jin Yang Cheol's fourth son.

563
00:45:06,720 --> 00:45:09,590
I didn't know the late chairman had a fourth son.

564
00:45:10,020 --> 00:45:13,490
I heard he'd cut ties with the family for some reason.

565
00:45:17,690 --> 00:45:19,300
- Mr. Shin? - Yes?

566
00:45:21,060 --> 00:45:22,200
Oh, right.

567
00:45:29,110 --> 00:45:30,110
Gosh.

568
00:46:00,340 --> 00:46:03,770
Wasn't that ex-Miss Soonyang and movie star...

569
00:46:04,010 --> 00:46:05,310
What was her name?

570
00:46:05,880 --> 00:46:07,140
She's 4-alpha.

571
00:46:07,940 --> 00:46:09,550
What? Then she's...

572
00:46:09,950 --> 00:46:12,950
Yes. She's married to Advisor Jin Yoon Ki.

573
00:46:13,420 --> 00:46:16,720
She's the exact reason he cut ties with the family.

574
00:46:16,820 --> 00:46:17,990
That's crazy.

575
00:46:18,350 --> 00:46:21,190
Do they have any children?

576
00:46:21,660 --> 00:46:22,860
They have a son.

577
00:46:22,860 --> 00:46:25,030
I heard 4-1 is into entertainment...

578
00:46:25,430 --> 00:46:26,960
that's not tied to Soonyang.

579
00:46:27,300 --> 00:46:29,200
He must be quite old.

580
00:46:29,570 --> 00:46:31,770
I guess it pays to come from a great family.

581
00:46:35,000 --> 00:46:37,540
His heart stopped twice during surgery,

582
00:46:37,940 --> 00:46:39,510
so while administering CPR,

583
00:46:40,110 --> 00:46:42,380
we inserted a stent in his aorta.

584
00:46:44,050 --> 00:46:47,220
As a result, this morning, oxygen saturation was good,

585
00:46:47,550 --> 00:46:50,420
and all numbers and levels have returned to normal.

586
00:46:51,220 --> 00:46:54,590
Oh, thank you. Thanks so much.

587
00:46:55,060 --> 00:46:57,230
- Thank you. - I must see him.

588
00:46:57,260 --> 00:47:00,900
Right now, complete rest is the best medicine.

589
00:47:02,060 --> 00:47:03,970
You cannot see him for a while.

590
00:47:04,570 --> 00:47:06,470
Please cooperate.

591
00:47:08,500 --> 00:47:09,740
Doctor Ahn.

592
00:47:10,840 --> 00:47:11,940
Just a moment.

593
00:47:17,650 --> 00:47:21,680
Hey. You still have that skill.

594
00:47:22,420 --> 00:47:25,020
You startle people by showing up.

595
00:47:25,020 --> 00:47:26,790
And you're still afraid.

596
00:47:27,860 --> 00:47:30,890
If you have nothing, you fear nothing.

597
00:47:32,430 --> 00:47:34,800
You should try harder, Auntie.

598
00:47:36,800 --> 00:47:39,840
Did you call her? As if anyone misses her.

599
00:47:40,570 --> 00:47:42,640
She doesn't even take my calls.

600
00:47:51,310 --> 00:47:52,950
A long time has passed.

601
00:47:55,480 --> 00:47:59,260
Am I still an unwelcome guest within the family?

602
00:47:59,260 --> 00:48:02,520
- You know that and... - If you knew what I brought,

603
00:48:05,130 --> 00:48:07,030
you couldn't mistreat me anymore.

604
00:48:08,300 --> 00:48:10,000
Let's hear it.

605
00:48:10,200 --> 00:48:12,470
What did you bring with you?

606
00:48:12,470 --> 00:48:13,570
Three percent.

607
00:48:15,270 --> 00:48:18,440
Three percent of Soonyang Corporation's shares.

608
00:48:23,380 --> 00:48:25,580
Once Soonyang becomes a holding company,

609
00:48:27,080 --> 00:48:30,820
when the time comes for you to fight over who becomes chairman,

610
00:48:34,490 --> 00:48:36,530
won't my three percent be the casting vote?

611
00:48:40,830 --> 00:48:42,000
What do you want instead?

612
00:48:48,670 --> 00:48:50,110
My son.

613
00:49:00,580 --> 00:49:01,750
I must know...

614
00:49:02,990 --> 00:49:05,190
the truth behind the accident that day.

615
00:49:08,620 --> 00:49:10,460
You all know!

616
00:49:14,800 --> 00:49:16,100
Bring me the answer.

617
00:49:17,970 --> 00:49:21,440
Then I'll hand over all I own.

618
00:49:30,280 --> 00:49:31,450
Thank you.

619
00:49:36,720 --> 00:49:38,590
Mr. Yoon, I need to talk to you about something.

620
00:49:38,850 --> 00:49:39,860
Sure.

621
00:49:39,890 --> 00:49:41,390
As you said, I separated the files to be discarded...

622
00:49:41,390 --> 00:49:42,930
from the ones we should keep.

623
00:49:43,260 --> 00:49:45,830
- The ones on the computer too? - Yes.

624
00:49:46,430 --> 00:49:48,900
But I found something.

625
00:49:50,670 --> 00:49:51,730
Well...

626
00:49:52,670 --> 00:49:54,940
This wasn't on the list.

627
00:49:57,640 --> 00:50:00,410
The thing is, it's an old document that is out of date.

628
00:50:00,410 --> 00:50:03,150
At first, I was just going to dispose of it. But I saw...

629
00:50:03,480 --> 00:50:06,950
a number of transactions involving large amounts in the span of years.

630
00:50:09,080 --> 00:50:11,250
You should go through it and decide what to do with it.

631
00:50:43,490 --> 00:50:44,550
(Confidential)

632
00:51:05,270 --> 00:51:08,180
As you can see, Soonyang Micro...

633
00:51:08,540 --> 00:51:11,750
is a dummy company that only exists on paper.

634
00:51:12,450 --> 00:51:14,650
The records show large transactions between the company...

635
00:51:14,680 --> 00:51:17,690
and Soonyang's subsidiaries that took place for over a decade.

636
00:51:17,920 --> 00:51:21,820
Despite Soonyang Micro's transaction and sales records,

637
00:51:21,860 --> 00:51:26,200
I could not find anything on the company...

638
00:51:26,560 --> 00:51:29,060
in any of Soonyang's contracts and financial documents,

639
00:51:29,800 --> 00:51:32,870
as if it had been hidden on purpose.

640
00:51:37,440 --> 00:51:38,910
Do you...

641
00:51:39,540 --> 00:51:42,740
realize what that means?

642
00:51:42,780 --> 00:51:45,550
Someone is siphoning Soonyang's money overseas...

643
00:51:47,150 --> 00:51:49,990
through this paper company, sir.

644
00:52:04,570 --> 00:52:06,600
- Sir. - This is...

645
00:52:07,070 --> 00:52:10,110
just a document that should've been disposed of long ago.

646
00:52:10,670 --> 00:52:11,970
Had there been a problem,

647
00:52:12,010 --> 00:52:14,440
Internal Affairs would've already dealt with it.

648
00:52:18,550 --> 00:52:20,820
Do you think you're more competent...

649
00:52:21,920 --> 00:52:23,820
than Soonyang's top-tier talent?

650
00:52:24,350 --> 00:52:25,550
But this is clearly...

651
00:52:25,590 --> 00:52:28,520
Mr. Yoon Hyeon Woo, the head of Future Asset Management.

652
00:52:35,230 --> 00:52:39,070
Do you know why I've been keeping you on for the past five years?

653
00:52:40,740 --> 00:52:45,010
You know exactly when to step in and when to back off. That's why.

654
00:52:46,180 --> 00:52:47,780
So keep it up.

655
00:52:48,780 --> 00:52:50,580
Do not make me repeat myself.

656
00:52:53,650 --> 00:52:54,950
Got anything else to say?

657
00:52:56,190 --> 00:52:57,220
No, sir.

658
00:53:13,740 --> 00:53:15,340
I guess you had to work late, Mr. Yoon.

659
00:53:25,650 --> 00:53:28,580
So? Have you finished organizing the documents?

660
00:53:33,760 --> 00:53:34,860
Yes, sir.

661
00:53:35,660 --> 00:53:36,790
It's been taken care of.

662
00:53:38,430 --> 00:53:39,530
I'll be off, then.

663
00:53:39,630 --> 00:53:41,660
(Chairman Jin Yang Cheol)

664
00:53:43,000 --> 00:53:44,670
It was white porcelain.

665
00:53:46,970 --> 00:53:49,340
My grandfather's vase that I broke.

666
00:53:50,510 --> 00:53:52,910
It wasn't Goryeo celadon. It was a white porcelain vase.

667
00:53:54,140 --> 00:53:57,710
But in his autobiography, he wrote that it was a Goryeo celadon vase.

668
00:53:59,820 --> 00:54:02,720
I swear, he knew nothing about me.

669
00:54:04,520 --> 00:54:05,790
You know more about me than he ever did.

670
00:54:12,230 --> 00:54:14,030
My grandfather always said...

671
00:54:15,030 --> 00:54:17,730
that Soonyang would go bust because of lazy fools like me.

672
00:54:18,970 --> 00:54:21,100
But once again, he was wrong.

673
00:54:22,040 --> 00:54:24,340
Sure, there are lazy fools like me at Soonyang.

674
00:54:28,280 --> 00:54:30,450
But the company has employees like you as well.

675
00:54:43,130 --> 00:54:45,060
You certainly deserve to wear the Soonyang badge.

676
00:54:49,700 --> 00:54:50,800
About that day...

677
00:54:52,330 --> 00:54:53,770
Thank you, Mr. Yoon.

678
00:55:02,440 --> 00:55:04,550
Don't look at me like that. You should get going.

679
00:55:08,050 --> 00:55:09,080
Yes, sir.

680
00:55:35,380 --> 00:55:37,350
(Chairman Jin Yang Cheol)

681
00:55:39,480 --> 00:55:40,550
Sir.

682
00:55:41,750 --> 00:55:43,090
There's something I must tell you.

683
00:55:44,920 --> 00:55:46,250
(Confidential)

684
00:55:50,630 --> 00:55:52,230
Soonyang's assets are being siphoned...

685
00:55:53,130 --> 00:55:55,130
into a paper company overseas in large amounts.

686
00:55:57,800 --> 00:55:58,830
And the prosecution...

687
00:55:59,330 --> 00:56:02,670
suspects that Soonyang has a large slush fund.

688
00:56:04,040 --> 00:56:06,510
Once the prosecution finds out about the paper company,

689
00:56:07,440 --> 00:56:09,140
the company will be charged...

690
00:56:09,140 --> 00:56:10,880
with embezzlement, breach of duty, and tax evasion.

691
00:56:10,880 --> 00:56:11,950
Also,

692
00:56:12,950 --> 00:56:15,150
the plans for the holding company and the succession will be affected.

693
00:56:17,190 --> 00:56:19,120
Then let me hear what you think I should do.

694
00:56:22,460 --> 00:56:25,130
You should make a move before the prosecution does.

695
00:56:25,390 --> 00:56:27,900
Submit a declaration of business closure for the paper company...

696
00:56:27,900 --> 00:56:28,960
and make sure...

697
00:56:30,170 --> 00:56:32,000
Soonyang Corporation absorbs the assets.

698
00:56:32,000 --> 00:56:33,170
That's my suggestion, sir.

699
00:56:34,970 --> 00:56:38,110
You found this in a cabinet in Planning and Coordination?

700
00:56:39,640 --> 00:56:40,710
That's correct, sir.

701
00:56:42,280 --> 00:56:44,150
Where is the original document?

702
00:56:46,210 --> 00:56:47,720
Not these photos you took.

703
00:56:49,320 --> 00:56:50,490
The original document.

704
00:56:55,620 --> 00:56:56,690
Pardon me?

705
00:57:00,030 --> 00:57:01,300
The original document...

706
00:57:03,470 --> 00:57:05,830
Sir, Mr. Kim is here.

707
00:57:06,230 --> 00:57:07,340
Okay.

708
00:57:19,710 --> 00:57:22,850
Mr. Yoon brought something interesting.

709
00:57:29,290 --> 00:57:30,360
(Confidential)

710
00:57:42,440 --> 00:57:43,540
Go on.

711
00:57:44,640 --> 00:57:46,010
Where's the original document?

712
00:57:49,310 --> 00:57:50,310
Well...

713
00:57:53,250 --> 00:57:54,820
I got rid of it, sir.

714
00:57:56,590 --> 00:57:57,690
You did?

715
00:57:58,520 --> 00:57:59,590
Yes, sir.

716
00:58:02,420 --> 00:58:04,630
If the existence of the paper company comes to the surface,

717
00:58:05,530 --> 00:58:06,560
someone...

718
00:58:09,200 --> 00:58:11,200
will try to destroy all evidence. That's why...

719
00:58:12,730 --> 00:58:15,240
I took and saved the photos and got rid of the original document.

720
00:58:17,440 --> 00:58:19,770
You made a wise choice, Mr. Yoon.

721
00:58:24,280 --> 00:58:26,310
I'd like to ask you something, Mr. Kim.

722
00:58:27,750 --> 00:58:29,990
About this paper company, Soonyang Micro.

723
00:58:30,420 --> 00:58:31,520
I bet you...

724
00:58:35,620 --> 00:58:36,930
You knew about it, didn't you?

725
00:58:39,330 --> 00:58:40,400
Pardon?

726
00:59:02,080 --> 00:59:03,750
Answer wisely, Mr. Kim.

727
00:59:04,920 --> 00:59:06,790
Sir, I...

728
00:59:06,790 --> 00:59:09,560
If you knew but didn't report it, you either...

729
00:59:10,760 --> 00:59:12,790
do not approve of me as your boss...

730
00:59:12,960 --> 00:59:14,900
or became greedy for that money.

731
00:59:17,800 --> 00:59:20,100
If you didn't know about it, that's even worse.

732
00:59:22,000 --> 00:59:23,870
It means you're incompetent.

733
00:59:29,950 --> 00:59:31,280
So which one is it?

734
00:59:35,580 --> 00:59:36,850
I apologize, sir.

735
00:59:49,560 --> 00:59:52,330
Either way, I now know that you've betrayed Soonyang.

736
01:00:17,130 --> 01:00:20,260
- Mr. Yoon. - Yes, sir.

737
01:00:20,300 --> 01:00:21,900
- You have a valid passport, right? - Yes.

738
01:00:22,160 --> 01:00:23,700
As of today, you're the senior finance manager...

739
01:00:23,700 --> 01:00:25,230
of the Planning and Coordination Department.

740
01:00:26,570 --> 01:00:29,270
Go retrieve Soonyang's assets that have been siphoned off overseas.

741
01:00:30,440 --> 01:00:33,810
That is your first mission as the senior finance manager.

742
01:00:38,050 --> 01:00:39,550
I trust that you'll do a good job.

743
01:00:48,420 --> 01:00:50,060
I'll do my best, sir.

744
01:01:20,360 --> 01:01:22,190
I've done some thinking, Father.

745
01:01:23,290 --> 01:01:25,060
You were right.

746
01:01:26,730 --> 01:01:28,230
So now,

747
01:01:30,170 --> 01:01:32,570
I must have something to my name.

748
01:01:35,240 --> 01:01:38,540
The new Soonyang and its glowing future will be mine.

749
01:01:41,280 --> 01:01:44,380
Soonyang's dark past shall perish with you, Father.

750
01:01:57,190 --> 01:01:59,130
Until the succession is completed,

751
01:02:01,300 --> 01:02:03,300
just keep on breathing like this.

752
01:02:23,420 --> 01:02:24,690
Please sign here.

753
01:02:39,570 --> 01:02:41,470
Okay. As you requested,

754
01:02:41,470 --> 01:02:45,370
we deposited 600 million dollars into your account, sir.

755
01:02:47,280 --> 01:02:49,210
You can now withdraw the entire balance...

756
01:02:49,210 --> 01:02:50,280
whenever you like.

757
01:02:52,310 --> 01:02:55,220
You became so wealthy at such a young age.

758
01:02:55,420 --> 01:02:57,320
Was it hard work or luck?

759
01:04:00,250 --> 01:04:02,350
Then let me hear what you think I should do.

760
01:04:03,220 --> 01:04:05,350
You should make a move before the prosecution does.

761
01:04:06,750 --> 01:04:08,690
Submit a declaration of business closure for the paper company...

762
01:04:08,690 --> 01:04:10,190
and make sure...

763
01:04:11,530 --> 01:04:13,130
Soonyang Corporation absorbs the assets.

764
01:04:13,130 --> 01:04:14,800
That's my suggestion, sir.

765
01:04:19,330 --> 01:04:21,070
Vice-Chairman Jin Seong Jun.

766
01:04:23,640 --> 01:04:25,240
Do you think you can indict him?

767
01:05:07,480 --> 01:05:09,420
Hey, where are you going?

768
01:05:09,620 --> 01:05:11,820
Is this the right way?

769
01:05:11,920 --> 01:05:14,990
Don't worry. This is the shortcut.

770
01:05:15,490 --> 01:05:17,960
Only we know. Taxi drivers.

771
01:05:36,180 --> 01:05:37,650
We're almost there.

772
01:05:38,550 --> 01:05:39,650
Okay.

773
01:06:02,500 --> 01:06:03,840
One minute left.

774
01:06:05,240 --> 01:06:06,270
Okay.

775
01:07:14,280 --> 01:07:16,280
Hey!

776
01:07:17,380 --> 01:07:19,310
Hey! Help!

777
01:07:19,810 --> 01:07:20,850
Hey...

778
01:07:23,850 --> 01:07:25,990
Are you okay? Let me help you up.

779
01:07:27,190 --> 01:07:28,360
Sorry.

780
01:08:19,610 --> 01:08:21,080
The 600 million-dollar slush fund.

781
01:08:24,150 --> 01:08:26,550
The slush fund created through Soonyang Micro.

782
01:08:28,950 --> 01:08:32,050
I heard Yoon Hyeon Woo went to retrieve and launder the money.

783
01:08:34,520 --> 01:08:35,790
Ye Jun.

784
01:08:36,690 --> 01:08:38,360
Who told you such nonsense?

785
01:08:39,060 --> 01:08:40,830
Our finance director.

786
01:08:42,760 --> 01:08:44,000
Do you want to meet him?

787
01:08:45,930 --> 01:08:46,930
Director Kim.

788
01:09:04,390 --> 01:09:05,720
Then the slush fund...

789
01:09:07,720 --> 01:09:08,860
Once it's retrieved,

790
01:09:11,190 --> 01:09:12,490
can I have it?

791
01:09:19,370 --> 01:09:20,940
Ye Jun, you've grown a lot.

792
01:10:26,730 --> 01:10:27,740
Mr. Shin.

793
01:10:29,300 --> 01:10:30,540
Why are you here?

794
01:10:41,950 --> 01:10:42,920
Mr. Shin.

795
01:10:43,780 --> 01:10:47,660
Why in the world... Why are you doing this to me?

796
01:10:51,030 --> 01:10:52,530
You told me...

797
01:10:54,630 --> 01:10:55,900
to never...

798
01:10:57,600 --> 01:11:00,870
disobey the higher-ups' orders or ask questions.

799
01:11:02,070 --> 01:11:05,110
You said I should never make my own judgement.

800
01:11:07,440 --> 01:11:08,480
I simply...

801
01:11:10,650 --> 01:11:11,980
followed your advice.

802
01:11:18,020 --> 01:11:19,050
Let go.

803
01:11:19,890 --> 01:11:21,860
Let go!

804
01:11:24,890 --> 01:11:25,890
Who is it?

805
01:11:27,430 --> 01:11:29,100
Who ordered you to do this?

806
01:11:39,110 --> 01:11:40,210
The person who needs this.

807
01:13:01,160 --> 01:13:02,290
Do Jun, you woke up?

808
01:13:05,730 --> 01:13:07,030
What? 4-alpha?

809
01:13:09,500 --> 01:13:11,700
We're almost there. Time to wake up.

810
01:13:14,870 --> 01:13:16,540
That's 4-0.

811
01:13:18,970 --> 01:13:20,610
Hey, what are you doing?

812
01:13:23,240 --> 01:13:25,680
Hey, then you must be 4-1.

813
01:13:25,680 --> 01:13:28,150
What? "Hey?"

814
